<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Akibuz | Cerámica Artesanal</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --color-principal: #5d5c58;
            --color-fondo: #f9f7f2;
            --color-texto: #333;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--color-fondo);
            color: var(--color-texto);
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 500px; }
        h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .description { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #555; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .links-container { width: 100%; max-width: 400px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
        .btn {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
            background: white; color: var(--color-principal); text-decoration: none;
            padding: 16px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 500;
            border: 1px solid #ddd; transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn:hover { background: #eee; transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .gallery {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 10px;
            max-width: 450px; margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .gallery img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1/1; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 2px; }
        footer { margin-top: 50px; font-size: 0.7rem; color: #aaa; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header">
        <h1>AKIBUZ</h1>
        <p class="description">
            Cerámica hecha a mano desde Aretxabaleta. Piezas únicas en arcilla blanca que buscan la armonía entre la imperfección y la simplicidad.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="links-container">
        <a href="https://www.etsy.com/shop/akibuz" target="_blank" class="btn">
            <i class="fa-brands fa-etsy"></i> TIENDA ONLINE (ETSY)
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/akibuz.ceramics/" target="_blank" class="btn">
            <i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i> INSTAGRAM
        </a>
        <a href="https://es.pinterest.com/AkibuzCeramics/" target="_blank" class="btn">
            <i class="fa-brands fa-pinterest"></i> PINTEREST
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:akristobal@maltuna.eus" class="btn">
            <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i> CONTACTO
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="gallery">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578749553348-47542c86231d?w=300" alt="Jarrones Akibuz">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610701596007-11502861dcfa?w=300" alt="Cerámica Minimalista">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1525498122393-3ddd204369e7?w=300" alt="Diseño en barro">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590422443606-c9c4e78f9f6b?w=300" alt="Textura orgánica">
    </div>

    <footer>
        Akibuz Studio &copy; 2026
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
